{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51836","headline":"沃洲山 · 魏证","name":"沃洲山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一声清磬海边月，十里香风涧底松。\n何代沃洲今夜兴，倚栏干听赤城钟。\n（《舆地纪胜》四《绍兴府》）（〖1〗《会稽掇英总集》卷四作魏徵诗，爲七律，此爲後四句。\n然魏徵平生未及东南，诗律成熟，亦非初唐所宜有。\n或另其魏证其人。\n参《全唐诗续拾》卷一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏证","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}